Read t[1..n] (1-indexed). In Java, we can use int[] t = new int[n+1]; for i=1 to n.

Initialize ans = 0.
Queue q = new ArrayDeque<>();
Start node: (MAX, MAX, UP, 1, 1). Note: In C++, they push node(MAX, MAX, UP, 1, 1). And they set marked[MAX][MAX][UP][1][1] = true. Also mp[MAX][MAX] = true, ans++.

In Java:
